  "description": "Passkeys (WebAuthn) for SlimIdentity: sign-in with Face ID, fingerprint or device PIN – phishing-resistant, multi-factor on its own, no user name needed. Registration for signed-in users, discoverable sign-in, rename and remove in the sign-in methods. ES256 and RS256, every check of WebAuthn Level 2 without attestation, atomic single use per challenge, clone detection. No third-party dependency, Native AOT compatible.",
